ces":["https://youtu.be/ME-r173X5b0?t=2034","stats"]},{"field":"usg","text":"He is the clear first option after Herro, Powell and Jaquez left. His usage stays near his 34.6 to 35.8% of the last two seasons.","sources":["https://youtu.be/nnWX_ObljOE?t=845","stats"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"One game of possible knee management late in the season. Miami is chasing a playoff spot and has no back-to-backs in the playoff weeks, so the rest risk is small.","sources":["https://youtu.be/gf_6GveiAls?t=1126","https://youtu.be/LM0cRCGoAUQ?t=306"]},{"field":"gp","text":"I keep Yahoo's 68. At least 15 of last season's missed games came during Milwaukee's tank, and Miami's light back-to-back schedule helps. His knee history is already priced into 68.","sources":["https://youtu.be/t4n9MAP2_14?t=253","https://youtu.be/gf_6GveiAls?t=1126"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}